/**
 * MCP Local Service Adapter
 *
 * Thin wrapper over @vreko/local-service-client providing workspace-scoped
 * connection management for MCP tools. Replaces the hand-rolled client-facade.ts
 * with the unified VrekoLocalClient package.
 *
 * Features:
 * - Lazy connection (connects on first request)
 * - Workspace-scoped client instances
 * - Graceful fallback (returns null when service unavailable)
 * - Auto-reconnect via package ReconnectManager
 * - Auto-start daemon when not running
 *
 * @module daemon/local-service-adapter
 */

