/**
 * Hybrid Retrieval Service
 *
 * Provides adaptive semantic+keyword retrieval for learnings.
 * Uses query classification to optimize RRF weights.
 *
 * P1 ENHANCEMENT: Now incorporates task intent (implement/debug/refactor/test/deploy)
 * for more relevant learning retrieval. Intent boosts domain-specific learnings.
 *
 * DOGFOODING P2: Redis pattern caching integrated for 20-50x latency reduction.
 * Cache hit rate target: 70-80% for common queries.
 *
 * Features:
 * - Adaptive weights based on query classification
 * - Intent-based domain boosting (P1 fix)
 * - Redis caching with 1-day TTL (P2 dogfooding)
 * - Confidence thresholding (skip hybrid when uncertain)
 * - Fallback to keyword-only when embeddings unavailable
 * - Cache invalidation on learning updates
 * - Auto-indexing of learnings on first use
 *
 * @see packages/intelligence/src/knowledge/retriever.ts
 *
 * DEPRECATED (Day 4): Direct @vreko/intelligence imports replaced with daemon IPC.
 * Hybrid retrieval now routes through the daemon.
 */

